{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"ALSA-2026:97586","published":"2026-11-10T00:00:00Z","modified":"2026-11-17T14:00:04.174535776Z","related":["CVE-2026-3592","CVE-2026-5950"],"upstream":["CVE-2026-3592","CVE-2026-5950"],"summary":"Moderate: bind security, bug fix, and enhancement update","details":"The Berkeley Internet Name Domain (BIND) is an implementation of the Domain Name System (DNS) protocols. BIND includes a DNS server (named); a resolver library (routines for applications to use when interfacing with DNS); and tools for verifying that the DNS server is operating correctly.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * bind: Amplification vulnerabilities via self-pointed glue records (CVE-2026-3592)\n  * bind: Unbounded resend loop in BIND 9 resolver (CVE-2026-5950)\n\n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):  \n\n  * Bind 9.16.23 DNSSEC Key Rollover with KASP Causes ZSK Key To Be Removed Prematurely (JIRA:RHEL-12487)\n  * nslookup does not return and hang at epoll_wait() on some special occasions. (JIRA:RHEL-29712)\n  * Update to latest minor version 9.16.50 [rhel-9.9] (JIRA:RHEL-6454)\n  * pkcs11-tools test failing on engine (JIRA:RHEL-213788)\n  * dig on s390x does not return output when fails (JIRA:RHEL-212648)\n  * bind: New root trust anchor key for DNSSEC [rhel-9.9] (JIRA:RHEL-255745)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.  \n\nAdditional Changes:  \n\nFor detailed information on changes in this release, see the AlmaLinux 9 Release Notes linked from the References section.\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"bind","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/bind"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"32:9.16.50-11.el9_9"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:97586.json"}},{"package":{"name":"bind-chroot","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/bind-chroot"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"32:9.16.50-11.el9_9"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:97586.json"}},{"package":{"name":"bind-devel","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/bind-devel"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"32:9.16.50-11.el9_9"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:97586.json"}},{"package":{"name":"bind-dnssec-doc","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/bind-dnssec-doc"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"32:9.16.50-11.el9_9"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:97586.json"}},{"package":{"name":"bind-dnssec-utils","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/bind-dnssec-utils"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"32:9.16.50-11.el9_9"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:97586.json"}},{"package":{"name":"bind-doc","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/bind-doc"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"32:9.16.50-11.el9_9"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:97586.json"}},{"package":{"name":"bind-libs","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/bind-libs"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"32:9.16.50-11.el9_9"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:97586.json"}},{"package":{"name":"bind-license","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/al